<title>ITALY: Italy Dec LIFFE BTP contract hits new record high.</title>
<headline>Italy Dec LIFFE BTP contract hits new record high.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The December Italian BTP bond futures contract on London's LIFFE market hit a record high of 127.05 in morning trading, dealers said.</p>
<p>By 0940 GMT, the December contract was up 36 basis point at 126.98.</p>
